OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Finitially this evening, but a band of
OL,7,Fheavy rain and strong winds will
OL,8,Fquickly sweep across the country. Rain
OL,9,Fand winds easing later with showers
OL,10,Ffollowing. Remaining mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA day of sunshine and
OL,13,Fblustery showers, these turning heavy
OL,14,Fand thundery at times. A little cooler
OL,15,Fbut still warm in the sunshine with
OL,16,Fwinds also easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
